   The license of every distributed binary is also recorded in manifest.json
   and shown by `gpm list-remote`. See SOURCES.txt for exact source
   provenance and licenses/ for full license texts.

================================================================================
GPL COMPLIANCE
================================================================================

For the GPL-licensed binaries listed above, this project:

1. SOURCE CODE AVAILABILITY
   - Documents the exact source of each binary in SOURCES.txt, with SHA256
     checksums for tarball sources (verified at build time)
   - Publishes the complete build scripts in this repository

2. LICENSE DISTRIBUTION
   - Ships the full GPL license texts in the licenses/ directory of every
     release, together with this COPYING notice
   - Records each binary's license in manifest.json

3. NO ADDITIONAL RESTRICTIONS
   - Adds no terms beyond those of the original licenses

4. BUILD REPRODUCIBILITY
   - Builds run in pinned container images via grow_glochidium.sh and the
     CI workflow in .github/workflows/build-release.yml

To obtain the corresponding source code, use the URLs in SOURCES.txt or open
an issue at https://github.com/uairhahs/glochidia/issues and it will be
provided.

